Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMonoNL Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1440
Set Height 900
Set Theme "OneDark"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "poplar"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "c"
Sleep 1s

Type "geoff@907.life"
Sleep 400ms
Escape
Sleep 200ms

Tab
Sleep 400ms
Tab
Sleep 400ms
Tab
Sleep 400ms

Type "Welcome to poplar"
Sleep 400ms

Tab
Sleep 800ms

Type "Poplar is a bubbletea terminal email client with first-class markdown support."
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Sleep 200ms
Type "Highlights:"
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Type "- threaded conversations"
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Type "CardDAV contacts"
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Type "outbox plus undo send"
Sleep 2s

